# Agent Autopsy — environment contract.
#
# Nothing here is needed for the replay path (`autopsy build`, `autopsy demo`,
# `autopsy verify`): those read committed traces and the committed store, with
# no network and no credentials (constitution §IV and §VI).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` only if you work on the optional live path
# (stretch item, M6). `.env` is git-ignored; this file is the only environment
# artefact that is committed, and it never carries a real value.

# --- Relate CLI ------------------------------------------------------------
# The `relate` binary is NOT on PATH by default. The store seam
# (`src/autopsy/store.py`) resolves it in this order: an explicit argument,
# this variable, `~/.local/bin/relate`, then PATH. Set it only when your
# binary lives somewhere else.
# AUTOPSY_RELATE_BIN=/home/you/.local/bin/relate

# --- Live path: provider selection is an environment decision --------------
# AUTOPSY_PROVIDER=
# AUTOPSY_MODEL=
# AUTOPSY_API_KEY=

# --- Hard caps on any live run (constitution §VI) --------------------------
# An uncapped loop spends real money on someone else's card.
# AUTOPSY_MAX_STEPS=20
# AUTOPSY_MAX_TOKENS=50000
